{
  "<p>This app is a powerful tool. Improper use may result in unintentional loss of data, exposed personal information or incur mobile carrier costs. Use with caution, this software comes with ABSOLUTELY NO WARRANTY. Click <i>Accept</i> to acknowledge that you have read, accepted and agree to be bound by the terms and conditions in the <a href=intent:#Intent;component=com.llamalab.automate/.EulaActivity;end>End User License Agreement</a>.</p>This app respects your privacy therefore it doesn’t show ads nor gather usage statistics (analytics), and its optional features that do require “personal information” only collect the essential data. This app uses <i>Google Play services</i> which collect version information about its components, the OS, this app and the app (store) that installed it. See <a href=intent:#Intent;component=com.llamalab.automate/.PrivacyPolicyActivity;end>Privacy Policy</a>."
  "<p>本应用功能强大。使用不当可能导致数据意外丢失、个人信息泄露或产生运营商费用，请谨慎使用。本软件不提供任何明示或暗示的保证。点击<i>接受</i>即表示您确认已阅读并接受<a href=intent:#Intent;component=com.llamalab.automate/.EulaActivity;end>最终用户许可协议</a>中的条款。</p>本应用尊重您的隐私，因此不会展示广告或收集使用统计信息（分析数据）。需要使用“个人信息”的可选功能仅会收集必要信息。本应用使用<i>Google Play 服务</i>；该服务会收集其组件、操作系统、本应用以及安装本应用的应用商店的版本信息。请参阅<a href=intent:#Intent;component=com.llamalab.automate/.PrivacyPolicyActivity;end>隐私政策</a>。"
}
{
  "<p>Allow <b>Automate</b> to %1$s?</p>A rooted device is required, otherwise <a href=intent:/adb.html#Intent;component=com.llamalab.automate/.HelpActivity;end>adb</a> has to be used."
  "<p>是否允许 <b>Automate</b>%1$s？</p>此操作需要已获取 root 权限的设备；否则必须使用 <a href=intent:/adb.html#Intent;component=com.llamalab.automate/.HelpActivity;end>adb</a>。"
}
{
  "<b>Automate</b> can request installation of app packages, ensure they come from trusted sources. No data is collected or shared, see <a href=intent:/privacy.html#Intent;component=com.llamalab.automate/.HelpActivity;end>Privacy Policy</a>."
  "<b>Automate</b> 可以请求安装应用包。请确保应用包来自可信来源。本应用不会收集或共享数据，详情请参阅<a href=intent:/privacy.html#Intent;component=com.llamalab.automate/.HelpActivity;end>隐私政策</a>。"
}
{
  "<b>Automate</b> features that may access or collect “personal information” has an age restriction, see <a href=intent:/privacy.html#Intent;component=com.llamalab.automate/.HelpActivity;end>Privacy Policy</a>. Can’t be changed once confirmed."
  "<b>Automate</b> 中可能访问或收集“个人信息”的功能设有年龄限制。请参阅<a href=intent:/privacy.html#Intent;component=com.llamalab.automate/.HelpActivity;end>隐私政策</a>。确认后无法更改。"
}
{
  "<b>Automate</b> require the following privileges to %1$s:"
  "<b>Automate</b> 需要以下权限才能%1$s："
}
{
  "<b>Automate</b> requires access to location data while in the background to run a flow including the <i>Bluetooth device scan</i>, <i>Cell signal strength</i>, <i>Cell tower near</i>, <i>Location at</i>, <i>Location get</i>, <i>Location mock</i>, <i>Mobile service set state</i>, <i>Network service discover</i>, <i>Wi-Fi network connect</i>, <i>Wi-Fi network connected</i> or <i>Wi-Fi network scan</i> block. No data is collected or shared, see <a href=intent:/privacy.html#Intent;component=com.llamalab.automate/.HelpActivity;end>Privacy Policy</a>."
  "<b>Automate</b> 需要在后台访问位置信息，才能运行包含以下块的流程：<i>蓝牙设备扫描</i>、<i>蜂窝信号强度</i>、<i>附近的蜂窝基站</i>、<i>指定位置</i>、<i>获取位置</i>、<i>模拟位置</i>、<i>设置移动网络服务状态</i>、<i>发现网络服务</i>、<i>连接 Wi-Fi 网络</i>、<i>Wi-Fi 网络已连接</i>或<i>扫描 Wi-Fi 网络</i>。本应用不会收集或共享数据。请参阅<a href=intent:/privacy.html#Intent;component=com.llamalab.automate/.HelpActivity;end>隐私政策</a>。"
}
{
  "<b>Automate</b> requires the following privilege to %1$s:"
  "<b>Automate</b> 需要以下权限才能%1$s："
}
{
  "<b>Automate</b> uses the <i>Accessibility API</i> to interact with the UI, intercept key presses and read notifications & “toast” messages. No data is collected or shared, see <a href=intent:/privacy.html#Intent;component=com.llamalab.automate/.HelpActivity;end>Privacy Policy</a>."
  "<b>Automate</b> 使用<i>无障碍 API</i>与界面交互、拦截按键，并读取通知和“Toast”提示。本应用不会收集或共享数据。请参阅<a href=intent:/privacy.html#Intent;component=com.llamalab.automate/.HelpActivity;end>隐私政策</a>。"
}
{
  "<b>Automate</b> uses the <i>Accessibility API</i> to show an accessibility button and intercept its presses. No data is collected or shared, see <a href=intent:/privacy.html#Intent;component=com.llamalab.automate/.HelpActivity;end>Privacy Policy</a>."
  "<b>Automate</b> 使用<i>无障碍 API</i>显示无障碍按钮并响应按钮操作。本应用不会收集或共享数据。请参阅<a href=intent:/privacy.html#Intent;component=com.llamalab.automate/.HelpActivity;end>隐私政策</a>。"
}
{
  "<b>Use with caution!</b> Disable the <i>Run on system startup</i> option in <a href=intent:#Intent;component=com.llamalab.automate/.prefs.SettingsActivity;end>settings</a> during testing, and read the <a href=intent:/safe_mode.html#Intent;component=com.llamalab.automate/.HelpActivity;end>Safe mode</a> help page."
  "<b>请谨慎操作！</b> 测试期间，请在<a href=intent:#Intent;component=com.llamalab.automate/.prefs.SettingsActivity;end>设置</a>中关闭<i>开机时运行</i>，并阅读<a href=intent:/safe_mode.html#Intent;component=com.llamalab.automate/.HelpActivity;end>安全模式</a>帮助页面。"
}
{
  "<b>Automate</b> will have its permissions automatically revoked if not “interacted” with over a few months, possibly causing long running flows to fail, disable the <i>Remove permissions if app isn’t used</i> option in menu, <i>Play Protect</i>, <i>Permissions for Unused Apps</i>. Click <i>Forget</i> if it’s unavailable."
  "如果几个月内未使用 <b>Automate</b>，系统可能会自动撤销其权限，导致长期运行的流程失败。请在菜单的 <i>Play Protect</i> → <i>未使用的应用的权限</i>中关闭<i>应用未使用时移除权限</i>。如果找不到此选项，请点按<i>忘记</i>。"
}
