  "The activity should be considered as an alternative selection action to the data the user has currently selected."
  "该活动应被视为用户当前已选择的数据的替代选择操作"
}
{
  "The app allows debugging of its code, even when installed on a non-development system."
  "该应用程序允许在非开发系统上安装时对其代码进行调试"
}
{
  "The app asks that only full-data streaming backups of its data be performed even though it defines a backup agent."
  "该应用程序要求仅执行其数据的完全数据流备份，即使它定义了备份代理"
}
{
  "The app has code associated with it."
  "应用有代码关联与它."
}
{
  "The app holds the FACTORY_TEST permission and the device is running in factory test mode."
  "该应用程序持有 FACTORY_TEST 权限，设备正在运行在出厂测试模式下"
}
{
  "The app is allowed to perform the operation."
  "应用是允许到执行操作."
}
{
  "The app is declared as game."
  "该应用程序被声明为游戏"
}
{
  "The app is installed as an update to a built-in system app."
  "该应用程序安装为内置系统应用的更新"
